<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-18T22:14:09.140Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:14:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces have bombed gang leader Jeff's luxury mansion and destroyed the Mawozo headquarters, killing about 20 gang members, while Haitian security forces retook the national stadium after two years of gang control. Haiti formalised a security pact with El Salvador and deployed Salvadoran troops who have engaged in combat against gangs, prompting both supportive and oppositional street protests. The United Nations warned that anti-gang operations must prioritise civilian protection, and the EU imposed sanctions on four Haitian gangs for serious human rights violations. Martine Moise, widow of the assassinated former leader, has registered to contest the presidential election. The UCDP recorded 193 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/bukele-confirms-airstrike-on-haitian-gang-leader-jeffs-luxury-mansion&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOVHA1Y3h1M05Wd0dkTnRlMmVwbkxPOEJqQlZfS3docHVmTzBGSDc4akRpVmM2TzRmMjE4WjJCTURuWm5QTGxJc3h6c3B2TEk0RldiYm44elZCQVB0emhLNjF3VFBLZjM0YmZhNEJsbXcwWXFCMVZhRWpFWWExaHkxUV9ZakZzWjFWVEJXaXF1X0hYU05wcmtYMTRocTBkNmlCT3Zid2VPQVZ5MnE4X1M5bjZn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOZ2s0dno3cU93TVUxOWIxX21fRjZWR3lScWhkSFZWcXlyb3diOW1nSkVMOEZGeU1QaE9YZEtsUld6VlJBZDd4anhrY01CVHJYaTl0Qmdqc1dDVm5CMUkwYjF6Z2pqem5YaUw5UTFueHhkTnc2b2E3cUR4YUFsNnMydmFpRG1CMm5WclBERFRhcDZ5WW5PRmppN2J2VGZOOHNzUmFjNFljZGIzZ0lQblVlWVRnN0lrcWxaVl9oN1oxSEg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxQWXVnYVJwWXlNUTY3RmFKdHpaclkxa1p0aFBsdV9BaGp0NUVNdFpyZDdzTXFqcDJkdUlyZVFuUF9DalNDaFpVc2lrZE94UV9fNGha